er": 36, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "Note", "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["## 4 · Coarse 3D model\nTRELLIS.2 / Pixal3D build the shape at 1024. The coarse mesh is saved to `output/Direct3D-V3/coarse` for a before/after."], "color": "#222", "bgcolor": "#000"}, {"id": 56, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [3340, 90], "size": [330, 170], "flags": {}, "order": 36, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "Note", "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["## 5 · Remesh twice\nDirect3D-V3 keeps what the coarse mesh gives it, so stair-steps and broken thin parts carry into the result. Two remesh passes clean them first.\n\nSharper but rougher: connect **Decode coarse mesh** straight to Direct3D-V3."], "color": "#222", "bgcolor": "#000"}, {"id": 60, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [3795, 90], "size": [666.353125, 330], "flags": {}, "order": 36, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "Note", "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["## 6 · Direct3D-V3\nRefines the mesh against your image at 1536. About 1 to 4 minutes on an RTX 5080.\n\n**Memory:** up to 13 GB VRAM and 21 GB RAM at 150,000 tokens. Less memory: lower `max_tokens` (`shrink_to_fit` then scales the model down a little) or set `resolution` to 1024.\n\n**More definition:** 15 steps (twice the time).\n\nResult: `output/Direct3D-V3/refined_1536_<id>.glb`, 10 to 35 million faces. Decimate it for games.\n\nNodes by Mstafa-awad, model by DreamTechAI (MIT)."], "color": "#222", "bgcolor": "#000"}, {"id": 59, "type": "Direct3DRefineConnectedClean", "pos": [3795, 480], "size": [666.353125, 458], "flags": {}, "order": 4, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "coarse_mesh", "name": "coarse_mesh", "type": "*", "link": 90}, {"localized_name": "image", "name": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "link": 91}, {"localized_name": "foreground_mask", "name": "foreground_mask", "shape": 7, "type": "MASK", "link": 92}, {"localized_name": "resolution", "name": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": 